  description: '2 Level 4 monsters

    You can discard 1 "Plunder Patroll" card,
    then target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; banish it, then you can 
    add 1 "Plunder Patroll" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. This is a Quick
    Effect if this card is equipped with a "Plunder Patroll" card. You can only use
    this effect of "Plunder Patrollship Moerk" once per turn. If a "Plunder Patroll"
    card(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can detach
    1 material from this card instead.'
